# The names that this project declares as a type or as a template.
# `cargo xtask seed collect` writes this file. The reader is xtask/src/seed.rs.
# The rows ascend by the bytes of the name, and a reader binary searches them.
# A COMMITTED SEED IS THE MEMORY OF WHAT A PROJECT DECLARES. `cargo xtask seed check`
# collects again and fails on any name added, any name removed, and any kind changed.
# A change to this file changes every parse that loads it, so the commit that makes
# the change must say which names moved and why.
